{"severity":"error","file":"errors/cap_widen_1.march","start_line":24,"start_col":4,"end_line":24,"end_col":17,"message":"`Cap(IO.Console)` cannot be widened to `Cap(IO.FileWrite)` — `cap_narrow` only attenuates, so the source capability must subsume the target.\nhelp: `Cap(IO.FileWrite)` is not below `Cap(IO.Console)` in the capability lattice. Receive it from a caller that holds an ancestor of it.","code":"cap_widen","fix":null,"labels":[],"notes":[]}
